diff -ruN -x __pycache__ -x .pytest_cache -x _hidden a/docs/api.md b/docs/api.md
--- a/docs/api.md	2026-11-12 01:26:27
+++ b/docs/api.md	2026-11-12 03:07:24
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 
 - `shipments.create_shipment(customer_id, weight_kg, zone)`: book a shipment
 - `shipments.get_shipment(shipment_id)`: fetch one shipment
+- `shipments.split_shipment(shipment_id, weights)`: replace a shipment in status "created" with one new shipment per weight (same customer and zone), in the order given; the original becomes status "split". Weights must be positive finite numbers that sum to the original weight. Errors: `E_NOT_FOUND` (no such shipment), `E_BAD_INPUT` (bad `shipment_id`, or `weights` not a non-empty list/tuple), `E_BAD_WEIGHT` (invalid weight, or sum does not match), `E_BAD_STATE` (shipment not in status "created")
 
